t can also be added to flour to make bread and cookies">It can also be added to flour to make bread and cookies</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="consumed directly">consumed directly</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="or used as a seasoning">or used as a seasoning</span>.</p><p><em>Nota: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="The medicinal value is referenced from">The medicinal value is referenced from</span> &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="Bencao Gangmu">Bencao Gangmu</span>&#8221; y &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="Shennong Bencao Jing.">Shennong Bencao Jing.</span>&#8221;</em></p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_make_black_sesame_paste_using_sesame_powder"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="How to make black sesame paste using sesame powder">How to make black sesame paste using sesame powder</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="Speaking of black sesame powder">Speaking of black sesame powder</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="many might think of black sesame paste">many might think of black sesame paste</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="As a well-known nutritious product">As a well-known nutritious product</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="let’s understand its preparation process">let’s understand its preparation process</span>.</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="Ingredients">Ingredients</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="Black sesame powder">Black sesame powder</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="glutinous rice flour">glutinous rice flour</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="rice flour can also be used">rice flour can also be used</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="but it has a poorer consistency">but it has a poorer consistency</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="and fine sugar or powdered sugar">and fine sugar or powdered sugar</span>.</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="Roasting glutinous rice flour">Roasting glutinous rice flour</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="Place the glutinous rice flour in a pan and roast it over low heat until it turns yellow">Place the glutinous rice flour in a pan and roast it over low heat until it turns yellow</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="Once done">Once done</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="set it aside to cool">set it aside to cool</span>.</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="Mixing ingredients">Mixing ingredients</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="Combine the roasted and cooled black sesame powder with glutinous rice flour and stir well">Combine the roasted and cooled black sesame powder with glutinous rice flour and stir well</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="You can also add an appropriate amount of crushed nuts">You can also add an appropriate amount of crushed nuts</span>, mijo, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="black rice">black rice</span>, semilla de coix, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="corn">corn</span>, frijoles negros, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="red beans">red beans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="soybeans">soybeans</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="or Chinese yam powder according to your preference">or Chinese yam powder according to your preference</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_eat_black_sesame_powder"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="How to eat black sesame powder">How to eat black sesame powder</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>Entonces, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="aside from making black sesame paste">aside from making black sesame paste</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="what are other ways to consume black sesame powder">what are other ways to consume black sesame powder</span>?</p><ol><li style="list-style-type: none;"><ol><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="Direct consumption">Direct consumption</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="Due to its unique flavor and rich nutritional value">Due to its unique flavor and rich nutritional value</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="it can be consumed directly">it can be consumed directly</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="which is convenient and quick">which is convenient and quick</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="allowing you to absorb its nutrients">allowing you to absorb its nutrients</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="Adding to flour">Adding to flour</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="It can be added to flour to make baked goods such as bread and cookies">It can be added to flour to make baked goods such as bread and cookies</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="effectively enhancing the flavor">effectively enhancing the flavor</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="Making black sesame-filled tangyuan">Making black sesame-filled tangyuan</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="This is essential">This is essential</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="especially during the Lantern Festival">especially during the Lantern Festival</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="a traditional Chinese holiday when people eat tangyuan">a traditional Chinese holiday when people eat tangyuan</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="Black sesame filling is loved by all ages">Black sesame filling is loved by all ages</span>.</li></ol></li></ol><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Produce_Sesame_Powder_in_a_Factory"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="How to Produce Sesame Powder in a Factory">How to Produce Sesame Powder in a Factory</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="In a factory">In a factory</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="sesame powder is typically produced using the following four methods">sesame powder is typically produced using the following four methods</span>:</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="A_Roasting_and_Grinding_Method"></span>A. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="Roasting and Grinding Method">Roasting and Grinding Method</span>:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="The sesame seeds are washed and roasted until dry">The sesame seeds are washed and roasted until dry</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="then ground into powder using a grinder">then ground into powder using a grinder</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="This is the most common method">This is the most common method</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="suitable for small-scale production">suitable for small-scale production</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="B_Baking_and_Crushing_Method"></span>B. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="Baking and Crushing Method">Baking and Crushing Method</span>:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame seeds are baked using specialized equipment and then quickly cooled before being crushed with a grinder">Sesame seeds are baked using specialized equipment and then quickly cooled before being crushed with a grinder</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="This method allows for better control over the degree of roasting and aroma">This method allows for better control over the degree of roasting and aroma</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="making it suitable for medium-scale production">making it suitable for medium-scale production</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="C_Airflow_Crushing_Method"></span>do. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="Airflow Crushing Method">Airflow Crushing Method</span>:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="This method utilizes high-speed airflow to create rapid collisions and friction between sesame particles to achieve crushing">This method utilizes high-speed airflow to create rapid collisions and friction between sesame particles to achieve crushing</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="It is highly efficient for large-scale production and can produce sesame powder with a narrow particle size distribution">It is highly efficient for large-scale production and can produce sesame powder with a narrow particle size distribution</span>.</p><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="D_Ultrafine_Crushing_Method"></span>D. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="Ultrafine Crushing Method">Ultrafine Crushing Method</span>:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><