ost during the production of it">Many people may wonder if the nutrient content is lost during the production of it</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="You can rest assured that there is minimal nutrient loss during the production process">You can rest assured that there is minimal nutrient loss during the production process</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="Once black sesame is ground into powder">Once black sesame is ground into powder</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="there is almost no nutrient loss">there is almost no nutrient loss</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="as grinding is primarily a physical process that preserves most nutrients">as grinding is primarily a physical process that preserves most nutrients</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="with only a small amount of fine powder sticking to the grinding tool">with only a small amount of fine powder sticking to the grinding tool</span>. Por lo tanto, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="you can safely consume black sesame powder to obtain its nutrients">you can safely consume black sesame powder to obtain its nutrients</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_Much_Does_Bulk_Black_Sesame_Powder_Cost"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="How Much Does Bulk Black Sesame Powder Cost">How Much Does Bulk Black Sesame Powder Cost</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="The price of bulk black sesame powder varies based on brand">The price of bulk black sesame powder varies based on brand</span>, calidad, origen, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="and sales channels">and sales channels</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="Based on market research">Based on market research</span>, <